Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.43,0:23:32.80,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)\blur1}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.35,0:23:36.23,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)\blur1}曾經每天掛著撲克臉
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.94,0:23:39.02,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)\blur1}對此假裝無動無衷
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.11,0:23:42.11,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)\blur1}突然而至的偶然
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.67,0:23:43.57,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)\blur1}啊啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.77,0:23:50.24,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)\blur1}和你（重疊的）觸碰（嘴唇）
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.24,0:23:56.08,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)\blur1}誕生的牽絆  從這裡開始
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.33,0:23:57.29,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)\blur1}ding! ging! dong!
