Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.56,0:24:20.06,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)\blur1}都是你的錯
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.40,0:24:25.57,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)\blur1}將青春之歌  奏響吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.78,0:24:31.49,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)\blur1}用純真的音符  就好啦
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.95,0:24:34.41,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)\blur1}ding! dong! No no no 不是這樣哦
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.79,0:24:37.29,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)\blur1}ding! dong! 你已經意識到了不是嗎
